# Roster module — loads last so it can read other modules' Scanner.results
# at broadcast time. Comms.lua must precede Init.lua because Init registers
# subprefix handlers against MC.Comms. Bitmap.lua precedes Init.lua so the
# bitmap encoder is available when v2 broadcast logic runs.
Modules\Roster\Comms.lua
Modules\Roster\Bitmap.lua
Modules\Roster\Init.lua
Modules\Roster\UI.lua
